  "description": "The Freemax Rexa SQ is a compact pod vape kit that combines power and design with the versatility of Freemax’s Duomax platform. With a box-style frame, 1300mAh battery, and 5–30W adjustable output, the Rexa SQ delivers a satisfying experience for MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-lung) vaping. Included in the kit is a 0.6ohm Duomax Pod, built with dual mesh coils and tea fibre cotton for longer-lasting flavour. Each pod is designed to handle vape juice of different types, accommodating up to 100ml of Freebase or 60ml of Nic Salt e-liquid , while the slide-to-fill top port ensures easy, mess-free refilling. The Rexa SQ features a hidden HD display that only activates when in use, revealing wattage and battery levels while maintaining a clean, minimal exterior. A nano-coated internal layout helps resist condensation build-up and leaking, while the airflow slider on the side allows for fine-tuned control over the draw. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
